<title>USA: University of Mo. bonds repriced, yields lowered.</title>
<headline>University of Mo. bonds repriced, yields lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co said Wednesday it repriced Curators of the University of Missouri's $136 million bond deal, lowering yields in several maturities but leaving the top yield in 2026 unchanged at 5.72 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
<p>THE CURATORS OF THE UNIVERSITY OF MISSOURI</p>
<p>RE: $135,995,000*</p>
<p>HEALTH FACILITIES REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>(UNIVERSITY OF MISSOURI HEALTH SYSTEM)</p>
<p>SERIES 1996A</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>NOTE REPRICING 1998-2001 AND COUPON CHANGE IN 2010.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>AMBAC INSURED</p>
